                          "text":  "On April 19, 2021, I spun up, lifted 3 metres off the ground, hovered, and came back down. Thirty-nine seconds. Under my solar panel I carry a scrap of cloth from the Wright brothers\u0027 first aeroplane. First flight on Earth, first flight on Mars.\n\nI was supposed to fly five times at most. I flew 72 times. I flew higher, faster and farther, and I became a scout for my rover, looking over the next hill. I got through a Martian winter and more than one rough landing.",
